  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "1/2 small onion (diced)",
    "6 medium pimento peppers (diced)",
    "1 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "1/8 teaspoon xanthan gum",
    "3/4 cup cheddar cheese (shredded)",
    "1 cup gruyere cheese (shredded)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "In a pot, melt the butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-queso-dip/#wprm-recipe-52477-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/keto-queso-dip-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the onions and sweet peppers, sauteing for 3-5 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-queso-dip/#wprm-recipe-52477-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/keto-queso-dip-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the onions are clear, pour in the cream and stir.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-queso-dip/#wprm-recipe-52477-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/keto-queso-dip-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in the xanthan gum. If it doesn’t thicken very much, add more.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-queso-dip/#wprm-recipe-52477-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/keto-queso-dip-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once your cream is thick and is bubbling, slowly stir in your cheddar cheese – one small handful at a time. Make sure it melts before adding more.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-queso-dip/#wprm-recipe-52477-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/keto-queso-dip-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Do the same thing with the Gruyere cheese, one small handful at a time. Add salt and pepper to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-queso-dip/#wprm-recipe-52477-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/keto-queso-dip-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with veggies, low-carb crackers, or throw on some low-carb nachos.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-queso-dip/#wprm-recipe-52477-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
